> Structural reading: the perfume is **ketone-led** — woody-amber ketones + ionone/irone ketones + rose ketone together dominate the spine, with macrocyclic musks and jasmine esters as the second mass, then EOs/resinoids for texture. Musk rows marked DRIFT below remove ~47 parts of the 96.2 musk-class parts until restocked.

