## 4. Compounding sequence (after stock prep)

1. Prepare/homogenize all PREP/VERIFY stocks first (Castoreum 10%, Norlimbanol 10%, Javanol 20%, Birch Tar 1%, Cinnamon 1%, Methyl Anthranilate 10%, Carrot Seed 1%, Evernyl homogenize, Coumarin rebase).
2. Resins + sweet/balsamic + leather/smoke traces + woods/ambers (rows 33, 39, 40, 57, 2–7, 11, 14–20, 24, 25, 28, 34, 35, 41–43, 45, 47, 50, 54, 61, 64, 91).
3. Musks (available rows: 26, 27, 31 only — do NOT add 9, 12, 22, 62, 63, 65 until substitution decision).
4. Floral/iris block (rows 3, 6, 8, 13, 16, 17, 21, 23, 36, 44, 48, 49, 51, 53, 55, 56, 68, 70–73, 79, 81, 84, 85, 87, 95, 96).
5. Spice/green/fruit (rows 59, 60, 66, 69, 74–78, 80, 82, 88–90, 92–94).
6. Citrus last (rows 38, 58, 67, 83, 86).
7. Ethanol 96% q.s. to exactly 30,000 µL. Rest concentrate; mature 6 weeks (Amouage-style reference) before any judgement.

